#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Playing &ksirk;"
msgstr "Igranje &ksirk;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preliminary note : the map can be scrolled by three methods:"
msgstr "Preliminarna napomena: mape se mogu pomicati prema tri metode:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can put your mouse near a border of the window and the map will scroll "
"in that direction"
msgstr ""
"Možete staviti vaš miš blizu granica prozora i mapa će se pomicati u tom "
"smjeru"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use your mouse wheel: with no modifier, it will scroll vertically; "
"when pressing the &Alt; key, it will scroll horizontally"
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti svoj roler miša: bez modifikatora, to će pomijerati "
"vertikalno; pritiskom na &Alt; ključ, pomijerat će se horizontalno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can use the keyboard arrows"
msgstr "Možete koristiti strelice tastature"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting a game"
msgstr "Pokretanje igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "When &ksirk; starts, you are presented with a main menu."
msgstr "Kada &ksirk; se pokrene, pojavi vam se glavni izbornik."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main menu of &ksirk;"
msgstr "Glavni izbornik &ksirk;"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main menu"
