#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Local Game"
msgstr "Nova lokalna igra"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starts a new game"
msgstr "Pokreće novu igru."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "Play &ksirk; over Jabber Network"
msgstr "Igrati &ksirk; preko Jabber Network"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Play &ksirk; over <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Extensible_Messaging_and_Presence_Protocol\">Jabber</ulink>. You need to "
"register Jabber account first."
msgstr ""
"Igrati &ksirk; preko <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Extensible_Messaging_and_Presence_Protocol\">Jabber</ulink>. Morate prvo "
"registrovati Jabber račun."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Standard TCP/IP Network Game"
msgstr "Nova standardna TCP/IP igra"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start a new game using <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Internet_protocol_suite\">Internet protocol suite</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Pokreće novu igru koristeći <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Internet_protocol_suite\">Internet protokol paket</ulink>."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Join Standard TCP/IP Network Game"
msgstr "Pridruži se standardnoj TCP/IP igri"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Join to the created by other user game using <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_protocol_suite\">Internet protocol suite</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Pridruži se kreiranom sa drugom korisničkom igrom koristeći <ulink url="
"\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_protocol_suite\">Internet protokol "
"paket</ulink>."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Učitaj"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use this to load a previously saved game"
msgstr "Koristite ovo da učitate prethodno spašenu igru"

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Quit</guimenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Izlaz</guimenu>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maybe you finally don't want to play?"
msgstr "Možda konačno ne želite igrati?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you hit <guibutton>New Local Game</guibutton> you will be presented with "
"the <guilabel>New game properties</guilabel> dialog where you will be able "
"to choose the number of players, the skin (or theme) to use, the game type "
"(conquer the goal or have a specific goal) and finally if this game will be "
"played with online players or if it is purely local. New skins can be "
"downloaded using <guibutton>Download New Skins</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko kliknete <guibutton> Nova Lokalna Igra </guibutton> biće vam "
"predstavljen <guilabel> Nove postavke igre</guilabel> dijalog u kojem ćete "
"moći birati broj igrača, kožu (ili temu) da koriste , tip igre (osvajanje "
"cilja ili imaj određeni cilj) i na kraju ako je to utakmica igrat će se sa "
"online igračima ili ako je to čisto lokalno. Nova tema se može preuzeti "
"koristeći <guibutton> Preuzimanje Nove Teme </guibutton>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The New Game dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Novi dijalog igre</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The New Game dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Novi dijalog igre</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start a TCP/IP network game, choose the <guilabel>New Standard TCP/IP "
"Network Game</guilabel> option on introduction screen. After clicking this "
"button you will be able to choose the network parameters: number of local "
"players and TCP port on which waiting for connections."
msgstr ""
"Da započnete TCP/IP mrežnu igru, odaberite <guilabel> Novi Standard TCP/IP "
"Mreže Igre </guilabel> opcija o uvođenju ekrana. Nakon što kliknete na ovo "
"dugme moći ćete odabrati parametare mreže: broj domaćih igrača i TCP port na "
"kojem čekaju za veze."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Network game parameters dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dijalog parametara mrežne igre</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Network game parameters dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dijalog parametara mrežne igre</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then, network players will be able to connect by choosing <guilabel>Join "
"Standard TCP/IP Network Game</guilabel> on the introduction screen and by "
"indicating the IP or hostname of the host and the port number you just set."
msgstr ""
"Zatim, mrežni igrači će moći da se povežu odabirom <guilabel>Pridruži se "
"Standardnoj TCP/IP Mrežnoj Igri</guilabel> na ekranu uvođenju i ukazujući na "
"IP ili ime domaćina i broj porta koji ste upravo postavili."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Joining network game dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pridruživanje dijalogu mrežne igre</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Joining network game dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pridruživanje dijalogu mrežne igre</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each connection is indicated by a new row in the <guilabel>Players</"
"guilabel> table below the map thumbnail."
msgstr ""
"Svaka veza je označena novim redom u <guilabel>Igrači</guilabel> tabeli "
"ispod karte thumbnail."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>New player row</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Novi red igrača</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>New player row</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Novi red igrača</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let's suppose you keep all the default settings and hit <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton>. You will then setup two players, one after one. For each one, "
"you'll choose a name, a nationality and, if you want, setup a password such "
"that nobody else than you can reuse this player when reloading this saved "
"game. Lastly, you will here specify if this player is played by the computer "
"or by a human being."
msgstr ""
"Pretpostavimo li da ćete zadržati sve podrazumijevane postavke i kliknite "
"<guibutton>Sljedeće</guibutton>. Tada ćete postaviti dva igrača, jedan za "
"drugim. Za svaki od njih, vi ćete odabrati ime, državljanstvo i, ako želite, "
"postaviti lozinke tako da niko drugi osim vas ne može ponovno koristiti ovog "
"igrača kada ponovo učita spašenu igru. Na kraju, vi ćete ovdje navesti ako "
"ovog igrača igra računar ili ljudsko biće."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Player Setup dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dijalog postavki igrača</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Player Setup dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dijalog postavki igrača</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then, after clicking <guibutton>Start</guibutton>, if you choose to play "
"with goal, the goal of each local player is displayed, preceded by a warning "
"such that other players looking at the same computer can discreetly turn "
"away while the goal is being viewed."
msgstr ""
"Zatim, nakon klika <guibutton>Početak</guibutton>, ako se odlučite igrati s "
"ciljem, cilj svakog lokalnog igrača se prikazuje, kojem prethodi upozorenje "
"poput da se drugi igrači gledajući isti računar mogu diskretno okrenuti, dok "
"se cilj gleda."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Goal Display warning message</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Ekran cilja poruka upozorenja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Goal Display warning message</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Ekran cilja poruka upozorenja</phrase>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Goal Display dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Ekran dijaloga cilja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Goal Display dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Ekran dijaloga cilja</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "Distribucija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the beginning of the game, countries are distributed to all the players. "
"Each country contains one army (represented by an infantryman) at the start. "
"Each player has some armies to distribute to his countries at their turn "
"(indicated by the presence of their name and their flag in the status bar). "
"Note that five armies are represented by a cavalryman and 10 by a cannon."
msgstr ""
"Na početku igre, zemlje se distribuiraju svim igračima. Svaka zemlja sadrži "
"jednu vojsku (koju zastupa pešadinac) na početku. Svaki igrač ima neke "
"vojske za distribuiranje njegovim zemalja na njegovom redu (ukazuje na "
"prisustvo njihovog imena i njihove zastave u status baru). Imajte na umu da "
"su pet vojski predstavljene sa konjanikom i 10 sa topovima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To put an army on one of your countries, click on it with the left mouse "
"button. To remove an army, click with the right button. Note, as a general "
"rule, that you will never be able to remove more armies than the number you "
"placed."
msgstr ""
"Da bi postavili vojska na jednu od svojih zemalja, kliknite na nju s lijevu "
"tipkom miša. Da biste uklonili vojsku, kliknite na desnu tipku. Napomena, "
"kao opće pravilo, da nikada neće moći da uklonite više vojske od broja koji "
"ste smjestili."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Placing armies</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Postavljanje vojski</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Placing armies</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Postavljanje vojski</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a player has distributed all there armies, the next player is "
"automatically selected to do the same task. When all players have finished "
"to distributing their armies, there is two possibilities that can be "
"selected by two buttons showed in the right panel:"
msgstr ""
"Kada je igrač distribuirao sve svoje vojske, sljedeći igrač se automatski "
"bira da učini isti zadatak. Kada svi igrači završe distribucije svojij "
"vojski, postoje dvije mogućnosti koje se mogu odabrati na osnovu dvije tipke "
"prikazane u desnom panelu:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "Redistribution"
msgstr "Redistribucija"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recycle"
msgstr "Recikliraj"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One player wants to change some of his choices. The first player can then "
"remove an army he just put in a country with the right mouse button and put "
"it in another one with the left mouse button. When he finishes, he gives "
"control to next player with the <guibutton>Valid</guibutton> button. When "
"all players have finished their redistribution, the two buttons are "
"displayed again."
msgstr ""
"Jedan igrač želi promijeniti neke od njegovih izbora. Prvi igrač tada može "
"ukloniti vojsku koju je on stavio na zemlji sa desnim klikom miša i staviti "
"još jednu sa lijevim klikom miša. Kada se završava, on daje kontrolu "
"sljedećem igraču sa <guibutton>Validan</guibutton>. Kada su svi igrači "
"završili svoje redistribucije, dva dugmeta se ponovo pojave."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid "End of redistribution"
msgstr "Kraj redistibucije"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:417
#, no-c-format
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Gotovo"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:419
#, no-c-format
msgid "The redistribution is finished and the game can continue."
msgstr "Redistribucija je gotova i igra se može nastaviti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fight"
msgstr "Borba"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After the redistribution, a turn starts. Each player plays at his turn. He "
"has the choice to:"
msgstr ""
"Nakon redistribucije, rotacija počinje. Svaki igrač igra na svom redu. Ima "
"mogućnosti da:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next player"
msgstr "Sljedeći igrač"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next Player"
msgstr "Sljedeći Igrač"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The turn of the current player finishes and it's the turn of the next one."
msgstr "Red trenutnog igrača završava i red je na sljedećeg."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid "Attack 1"
msgstr "Napad 1"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&nbsp;<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"attackTwo.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Attack 2</phrase> </"
"textobject> </inlinemediaobject> &nbsp;<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"attackThree.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Attack 3</phrase> </textobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject><guibutton>Attack with one, two or three armies</"
"guibutton> &nbsp;<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"autoattack.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Auto "
"attack</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> <guibutton>Auto attack</"
"guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"&nbsp;<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"attackTwo.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Napad 2</phrase> </"
"textobject> </inlinemediaobject> &nbsp;<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"attackThree.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Napad 3</phrase> </textobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject><guibutton>Napad sa jednom, dvije ili tri vojske</"
"guibutton> &nbsp;<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"autoattack.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Automatski napad</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> "
"<guibutton>Automatski napad</guibutton>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To attack, drag with the mouse from the attacking country and drop to the "
"attacked one. You will then be presented with a contextual menu showing the "
"above entries. <screenshot> <screeninfo>Attack menu</screeninfo> "
"<mediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"attackmenu.png\" format="
"\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Attack menu</phrase> </"
"textobject> </mediaobject> </screenshot> For a country X to attack a country "
"Y with x armies, 2 conditions must be fulfilled:"
msgstr ""
"Za napad, povucite sa mišem iz napadačke zemlje i spustite na napadnutu. "
"Tada će vam biti predstavljeni izbornik koji prikazuje stavke iznad. "
"<screenshot> <screeninfo>Izbornik napada</screeninfo> <mediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"attackmenu.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </"
"imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Izbornik napada</phrase> </textobject> </"
"mediaobject> </screenshot> Za državu X da napadne državu Y sa x vojski, 2 "
"uslova moraju biti ispunjena:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:503
#, no-c-format
msgid "the two countries must be neighbors;"
msgstr "dvije države moraju biti susjedi;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:504
#, no-c-format
msgid "country X must have at least x+1 armies before the attack."
msgstr "država X mora imati najmanje x+1 vojski prije napada."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the attack is valid, a dialog is displayed if necessary for the defender "
"to choose if he wants to defend with one or two armies or let the computer "
"decide."
msgstr ""
"Ako je napad validan, dijalog je prikazan ako je potrebno za branitelja da "
"odabere da li se želi braniti sa jednom ili dvije vojske ili dopustiti "
"računaru da odluči."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the defenders choice is done, the fight will occur and be completed. "
"This will described below."
msgstr ""
"Kada braniteljev odabir je gotov, bitka će se desiti i biti završena. Ovo će "
"biti objašnjeno ispod."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:511
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Defense dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dijalog odbrane</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:517
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Defense dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dijalog odbrane</phrase>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:531
#, no-c-format
msgid "Move armies"
msgstr "Pomjeri vojske"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:534
#, no-c-format
msgid "Move Armies from one country to another"
msgstr "Pomjeri vojske iz jedne države u drugu"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the last action of a player's turn. It gives the possibility to move "
"some armies from one of his country to another, neighboring the first one. "
"To choose the two countries, please drag and drop like you use during an "
"attack. When both countries are selected, a slider is displayed on which you "
"can choose how many armies there will be on each country afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je posljednja akcija igračevog reda. To daje mogućnost da se pomjeraju "
"neke vojske iz jedne njegove zemlje u drugu, susjednoj prvoj. Da biste "
"odabrali dvije zemlje, povucite i ispustite, kao što koristite za napad. Kad "
"su odabrane obje zemlje, a klizač se prikazuje na kojem možete odabrati "
"koliko vojski će biti na svakoj zemlji nakon toga."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid "Solution of the fight"
msgstr "Rezultat borbe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:552
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each army in the fight there is a corresponding die cast. The player who "
"rolls a higher number on the dice, whether being from the attacker or "
"defender, wins and the one to roll a smaller number on the dice loses armies "
"according to the number of dice thrown."
msgstr ""
"Za svaku vojsku u borbi postoji odgovarajuće bacanje umiranja. Igrač koji "
"dobije veći broj na kockice, bilo što od napadača ili branič, pobjeđuje i "
"onaj koji dobije manji broj na kockice gubi vojske prema broju kockice koja "
"je bačena."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:555
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Attack result displayed</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Prikazan rezultat napada</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:561
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Attack result displayed</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Prikazan rezultat napada</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the number of armies in the defender country reaches 0, the ownership of "
"this country changes to the attacker: his flag is set up and one of his "
"attacking armies is installed in his new country. The \"Move armies\" slider "
"is displayed as for the moves of the end of the turn."
msgstr ""
"Ako broj vojski u zemlji branitelja dosegne 0, vlasništvo ove zemlje mijenja "
"se na napadačevo: njegova zastava je postavljena i jedna od njegovih "
"napadačkih vojski je postavljena u njegovoj novoj zemlji. \"Pomjeri vojske\" "
"klizač se prikazuje za poteze na kraju red."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Invasion slider</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Klizač invazije</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Invasion slider</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Klizač invazije</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:584
#, no-c-format
msgid "End of the turn"
msgstr "Kraj reda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:585
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To finish your current turn, if you don't want to move armies, you can hit "
"the <guibutton>Next Player</guibutton> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Za završite vaš trenutni red, ako ne želite pomjeriti vojske, možete "
"kliknuti <guibutton>Sljedeći Igrač</guibutton> dugme na alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When everybody has played, the turn is finished. Some armies are distributed "
"to the players, in function of the countries they own: 1 for each group of "
"three countries, with a minimum of 3. There is also a bonus for players that "
"own a complete continent, different for each one. The values of the bonuses "
"for the default skin are:"
msgstr ""
"Kada su svi igrali, red je završen. Neke vojske su distribuirane igračima, u "
"funkciji od zemalja koje posjeduju: 1 za svaku grupu od tri zemlje, s "
"najmanje 3. Tu je i bonus za igrače koji imaju kompletan kontinent, različit "
"za svaki od njih. Vrijednosti bonusa za podrazumijevane teme su:"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:594
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus due to the continents"
msgstr "Bonus zbog kontinenata"

